#!/usr/bin/env python3
# Castle menu, opened from the tower on Waybar: night mode, sound, network, power.
#
# Night mode: while you drag, a background thread sends the newest values straight to
# Hyprland's socket (about 2ms each), so the slider never waits on anything.
# Once you stop, ~/.local/bin/nightmode saves them and updates the bar.
# Sound: volume of the default output (wpctl, newest value only while dragging),
# mute, and which output is the default (pactl). Network: wired/wifi status, no IP.
# Power: lock and sleep act at once; log out, reboot and shut down want a second
# click within a few seconds. Those three close apps cleanly through hyprshutdown.
# Escape or clicking somewhere else closes the menu (not while slurp/grim are taking
# a screenshot). P saves a 2x screenshot of the menu itself, transparent around the
# battlements, to ~/Pictures/Screenshots and copies it to the clipboard.
